      "message": "It looks like it isn\u0027t possible to hit this branch, because it\u0027s always called with `id` being the current thread id. However, I\u0027d prefer to keep it to future-proof in case this method is used with different ids in the future.\n\nThat said, I will fix it so that it only needs to traverse the tree once.",
